			"notes": "# Important information\n\nSome time ago, a virus called fracturiser has been found to have been hidden in some Minecraft mods and plugins. You may read my short article for information on how to check whether you are affected: [Fractureiser: Staying safe](https://gist.github.com/thefirethirteen/eca8e4a098611eeb1a33c6edd364280c).\n\n# Regular update stuff\n\n**Always BACKUP your worlds before updating!**\n\n## What's Changed\n\n* Update for Minecraft 1.20 and later\n\n## Translations needed!\n\nIf you notice the mod has either no support or partial support for your language, you can help with that! Please contact me on Discord @ thefirethirteen#4070 or open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/ReviversMC/modern-glass-doors/issues).\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ReviversMC/patterned-glass/compare/v3.2.0+1.19.4...v4.0.0+1.20-and-later"
		},
